 "remarks": "Direct Waterfront | Greens Farms | 2.6 Acres  An exceptional opportunity to create a private waterfront estate on 2.6 spectacular acres in the heart of Greens Farms. Overlooking Long Island Sound, Burying Hill Beach, and Sherwood Island State Park, this extraordinary property offers sweeping coastal vistas and a remarkable setting for a custom residence. With its generous acreage, waterfront location, and proximity to some of Westport's most desirable amenities, the property presents a rare opportunity to build a distinctive home along one of Connecticut's most coveted stretches of shoreline.  Ideally situated within walking distance of the Greens Farms train station and Greens Farms Academy, just 4 minutes to Southport Beach, 6 minutes to Pequot Yacht Club and historic Southport Village, and 10 minutes to Main Street in Westport and Staples High School. Approximately 55 miles from Manhattan, this exceptional waterfront parcel offers a unique combination of privacy, natural beauty, and convenience.",
